{"seq":1,"slug":"constructor-injection","title":"构造器注入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/implementation/constructor-injection","wordCount":1436,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"构造器注入\">构造器注入</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>构造器注入通过构造函数的参数列表显式声明类所需的全部依赖，是 Spring、.NET、NestJS 等主流框架一致推荐的首选注入方式。其核心优势在于四个方面：支持 final/readonly 字段保证不可变性和线程安全；对象创建即完全初始化消除 NPE 时间窗口；构造函数签名即依赖清单实现代码自文档化；循环依赖在编译期/启动期立即暴露迫使修正设计问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为何构造器注入是首选\">为何构造器注入是首选</h2><p>Spring Framework 从 4.3 版本开始在官方文档中明确推荐构造器注入，.NET Core 的内置 DI 容器从设计之初就围绕构造器注入优化，NestJS 的 Provider 系统默认通过构造函数解析依赖。三大主流生态不约而同的选择并非巧合，而是基于工程实践中反复验证的四个核心优势。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    CI[构造器注入的核心优势]&#10;    CI --&gt; Immutable[不可变性: final 字段保证线程安全]&#10;    CI --&gt; Complete[完全初始化: 对象创建即可用]&#10;    CI --&gt; Explicit[显式依赖: 构造函数即契约]&#10;    CI --&gt; Fail[快速失败: 循环依赖编译期暴露]&#10;&#10;    Immutable --&gt; Benefit1[多线程无需加锁]&#10;    Complete --&gt; Benefit2[消除 NPE 时间窗口]&#10;    Explicit --&gt; Benefit3[代码自文档化]&#10;    Fail --&gt; Benefit4[设计问题早期发现]\">graph TB\n    CI[构造器注入的核心优势]\n    CI --&gt; Immutable[不可变性: final 字段保证线程安全]\n    CI --&gt; Complete[完全初始化: 对象创建即可用]\n    CI --&gt; Explicit[显式依赖: 构造函数即契约]\n    CI --&gt; Fail[快速失败: 循环依赖编译期暴露]\n\n    Immutable --&gt; Benefit1[多线程无需加锁]\n    Complete --&gt; Benefit2[消除 NPE 时间窗口]\n    Explicit --&gt; Benefit3[代码自文档化]\n    Fail --&gt; Benefit4[设计问题早期发现]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势维度</th>\n<th>构造器注入</th>\n<th>字段注入（@Autowired on field）</th>\n<th>Setter 注入</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不可变性</td>\n<td>final 字段，创建后不可改</td>\n<td>无法 final，可被反射修改</td>\n<td>无法 final，可被多次 set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>初始化保证</td>\n<td>缺参数则编译/运行时立即报错</td>\n<td>容器注入失败可能延迟到首次调用</td>\n<td>set 前对象处于不完整状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖可见性</td>\n<td>构造函数签名即依赖清单</td>\n<td>需查看类内部字段才知道依赖</td>\n<td>需查看所有 setter 方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脱容器测试</td>\n<td>直接 new + Mock 参数</td>\n<td>需反射设置 private 字段</td>\n<td>new + 手动调用所有 setter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环依赖态度</td>\n<td>零容忍——立即报错</td>\n<td>Spring 三级缓存可绕过</td>\n<td>允许循环</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"不可变性与线程安全\">不可变性与线程安全</h2><p>构造器注入的核心技术优势是支持 <code>final</code>（Java）/ <code>readonly</code>（C#）/ <code>const</code>（Go 通过值语义）字段。不可变字段带来的保证：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对象创建后依赖引用不可被替换，消除运行时意外变更风险</li>\n<li>Java 内存模型保证 final 字段的 happens-before 语义，多线程无需加锁</li>\n<li>编译器可对 final 字段做更激进的优化（内联、逃逸分析）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"public class OrderService {&#10;    // final 字段：一旦赋值不可更改&#10;    private final OrderRepository repository;&#10;    private final EventPublisher events;&#10;    private final PricingEngine pricing;&#10;&#10;    public OrderService(&#10;            OrderRepository repository,&#10;            EventPublisher events,&#10;            PricingEngine pricing) {&#10;        this.repository = Objects.requireNonNull(repository);&#10;        this.events = Objects.requireNonNull(events);&#10;        this.pricing = Objects.requireNonNull(pricing);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 所有方法都可安全地在多线程中调用&#10;    // 因为依赖引用不可能被其他线程替换&#10;    public Order createOrder(Cart cart) {&#10;        Money total = pricing.calculate(cart);&#10;        Order order = repository.save(new Order(cart, total));&#10;        events.publish(new OrderCreated(order.id()));&#10;        return order;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // final 字段：一旦赋值不可更改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OrderRepository repository;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EventPublisher events;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PricingEngine pricing;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            OrderRepository </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">repository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            EventPublisher </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            PricingEngine </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pricing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.repository </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Objects.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">requireNonNull</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(repository);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.events </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Objects.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">requireNonNull</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(events);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pricing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Objects.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">requireNonNull</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pricing);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 所有方法都可安全地在多线程中调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 因为依赖引用不可能被其他线程替换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Order </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Cart </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Money total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pricing.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">calculate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cart);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Order order </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repository.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">save</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cart, total));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        events.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderCreated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在多线程环境中（如 Web 服务器的请求处理），<code>final</code> 字段保证了 Java 内存模型中的 happens-before 语义：构造函数中对 <code>final</code> 字段的写入在构造函数返回后对所有线程可见，无需额外同步。这意味着以构造器注入+Singleton 模式注册的服务天然是线程安全的（就依赖引用而言）。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"完全初始化与快速失败\">完全初始化与快速失败</h2><p>构造器注入保证了一个关键不变式：<strong>对象要么完全初始化，要么不存在</strong>。不存在&quot;创建了但还没准备好&quot;的中间状态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Container as IoC 容器&#10;    participant OS as OrderService&#10;    participant Repo as IOrderRepository&#10;&#10;    Note over Container: 场景 A: 所有依赖满足&#10;    Container-&gt;&gt;Repo: 解析 IOrderRepository&#10;    Repo--&gt;&gt;Container: MySQLOrderRepo 实例&#10;    Container-&gt;&gt;OS: new OrderService(repo, pricing, events)&#10;    Note over OS: 对象从创建起即可用&#10;&#10;    Note over Container: 场景 B: 依赖缺失&#10;    Container-&gt;&gt;Container: 解析 IOrderRepository -- 未注册!&#10;    Container--&gt;&gt;Container: 抛出异常,OrderService 不会被创建&#10;    Note over OS: 对象根本不会以不完整状态存在\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Container as IoC 容器\n    participant OS as OrderService\n    participant Repo as IOrderRepository\n\n    Note over Container: 场景 A: 所有依赖满足\n    Container-&gt;&gt;Repo: 解析 IOrderRepository\n    Repo--&gt;&gt;Container: MySQLOrderRepo 实例\n    Container-&gt;&gt;OS: new OrderService(repo, pricing, events)\n    Note over OS: 对象从创建起即可用\n\n    Note over Container: 场景 B: 依赖缺失\n    Container-&gt;&gt;Container: 解析 IOrderRepository -- 未注册!\n    Container--&gt;&gt;Container: 抛出异常,OrderService 不会被创建\n    Note over OS: 对象根本不会以不完整状态存在</pre><p>这与 Setter 注入形成鲜明对比：Setter 注入允许对象在依赖未设置时就被创建和使用，NPE 可能在运行一段时间后才暴露。构造器注入将这个问题前移到应用启动阶段——如果 Composition Root 配置有误，应用直接启动失败，而非在生产环境的某个请求中崩溃。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"参数膨胀是设计信号\">参数膨胀是设计信号</h2><p>当构造函数参数超过 4-5 个时，直觉反应是&quot;构造器注入太啰嗦&quot;。正确的解读是：<strong>这个类承担了太多职责</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 反信号：7 个构造参数 = 类太胖&#10;public class OrderProcessor {&#10;    public OrderProcessor(&#10;        OrderRepository orderRepo,&#10;        ProductRepository productRepo,&#10;        InventoryService inventory,&#10;        PricingEngine pricing,&#10;        PaymentGateway payment,&#10;        NotificationService notification,&#10;        AuditLogger audit) { ... }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 反信号：7 个构造参数 = 类太胖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        OrderRepository </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">orderRepo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ProductRepository </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">productRepo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        InventoryService </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">inventory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        PricingEngine </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pricing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        PaymentGateway </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">payment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        NotificationService </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">notification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        AuditLogger </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">audit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) { ... }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>正确的应对是拆分：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 拆分后：每个类 2-3 个依赖，职责清晰&#10;public class OrderProcessor {&#10;    public OrderProcessor(&#10;        OrderCreator creator,&#10;        PaymentProcessor payment,&#10;        OrderNotifier notifier) { ... }&#10;}&#10;&#10;public class OrderCreator {&#10;    public OrderCreator(&#10;        OrderRepository orderRepo,&#10;        PricingEngine pricing,&#10;        InventoryService inventory) { ... }&#10;}&#10;&#10;public class PaymentProcessor {&#10;    public PaymentProcessor(&#10;        PaymentGateway gateway,&#10;        AuditLogger audit) { ... }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 拆分后：每个类 2-3 个依赖，职责清晰</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        OrderCreator </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">crea