\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaymentProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaymentProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        PaymentGateway </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">gateway</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        AuditLogger </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">audit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) { ... }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>构造参数数量</th>\n<th>信号含义</th>\n<th>建议行动</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1-3</td>\n<td>健康范围</td>\n<td>保持现状</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4-5</td>\n<td>可能需关注</td>\n<td>审视是否存在可合并的相关依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>很可能违反 SRP</td>\n<td>提取子服务，将相关依赖组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8+</td>\n<td>几乎确定需要重构</td>\n<td>立即拆分为多个聚焦的类</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>引入 Facade Service</strong>（门面服务）是一种常见的中间方案：将多个相关依赖打包成一个&quot;参数对象&quot;传入。但要谨慎——如果 Facade 只是把参数换了个搬运方式而没有封装行为，它只是把问题隐藏了而非解决。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"spring-4-3-的隐式构造器注入\">Spring 4.3+ 的隐式构造器注入</h2><p>从 Spring 4.3 开始，如果一个类只有一个构造函数，Spring 会自动用它进行注入，无需 <code>@Autowired</code> 注解：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"@Service&#10;public class UserService {&#10;    private final UserRepository repository;&#10;    private final PasswordEncoder encoder;&#10;&#10;    // 唯一构造函数——Spring 自动使用，无需 @Autowired&#10;    public UserService(UserRepository repository, PasswordEncoder encoder) {&#10;        this.repository = repository;&#10;        this.encoder = encoder;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> UserRepository repository;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PasswordEncoder encoder;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 唯一构造函数——Spring 自动使用，无需 @Autowired</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(UserRepository </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">repository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, PasswordEncoder </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">encoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.repository </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repository;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encoder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> encoder;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>结合 Lombok 的 <code>@RequiredArgsConstructor</code> 可进一步消除样板代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"@Service&#10;@RequiredArgsConstructor  // 自动生成包含所有 final 字段的构造函数&#10;public class UserService {&#10;    private final UserRepository repository;&#10;    private final PasswordEncoder encoder;&#10;&#10;    // 无需手写构造函数——Lombok 在编译期生成&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RequiredArgsConstructor</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 自动生成包含所有 final 字段的构造函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> UserRepository repository;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PasswordEncoder encoder;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 无需手写构造函数——Lombok 在编译期生成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这消除了&quot;构造器注入代码冗长&quot;这个曾经的反对理由。现代 Java 项目中，构造器注入的代码量与字段注入几乎一致，但保留了所有类型安全和不可变性优势。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"与-ddd-聚合根的契合\">与 DDD 聚合根的契合</h2><p>构造器注入天然契合领域驱动设计中聚合根的设计理念：聚合根在创建时必须满足所有业务不变式，不允许处于无效状态。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 领域服务：所有依赖在创建时注入并验证&#10;public class TransferService {&#10;    private final AccountRepository accounts;&#10;    private final TransactionLog txLog;&#10;    private final ComplianceChecker compliance;&#10;&#10;    public TransferService(&#10;            AccountRepository accounts,&#10;            TransactionLog txLog,&#10;            ComplianceChecker compliance) {&#10;        this.accounts = Objects.requireNonNull(accounts);&#10;        this.txLog = Objects.requireNonNull(txLog);&#10;        this.compliance = Objects.requireNonNull(compliance);&#10;        // 创建即就绪——与聚合根的&quot;始终有效&quot;原则一致&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public TransferResult execute(TransferCommand cmd) {&#10;        compliance.verify(cmd);&#10;        Account from = accounts.findById(cmd.fromId());&#10;        Account to = accounts.findById(cmd.toId());&#10;        from.debit(cmd.amount());&#10;        to.credit(cmd.amount());&#10;        txLog.record(cmd);&#10;        return TransferResult.success();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 领域服务：所有依赖在创建时注入并验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TransferService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AccountRepository accounts;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TransactionLog txLog;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ComplianceChecker compliance;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TransferService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            AccountRepository </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">accounts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            TransactionLog </span><span style=\"color: