n style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TransferResult </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(TransferCommand </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cmd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        compliance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">verify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cmd);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Account from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cmd.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fromId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Account to </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cmd.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        from.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">debit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cmd.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        to.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">credit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cmd.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        txLog.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cmd);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TransferResult.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">success</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>构造器注入 + final 字段 + null 检查构成了&quot;创建即验证&quot;的不变式守护模式，确保服务对象在其整个生命周期中始终处于有效、一致的状态。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>构造器注入之所以被所有主流框架一致推荐，源于其在不可变性、完全初始化、依赖显式化和快速失败四个维度上的综合优势。构造参数膨胀不是注入方式的缺陷而是类职责过重的信号，正确应对是拆分而非切换注入方式。现代框架（Spring 4.3+ 隐式注入、Lombok @RequiredArgsConstructor）已经消除了&quot;代码冗长&quot;的历史反对理由。构造器注入 + final 字段构成的&quot;创建即验证&quot;模式是构建线程安全、可测试、职责清晰的服务对象的基石。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>相关文档：<a href=\"scope-lifecycle\">作用域与生命周期</a> 深入探讨这些构造器注入的对象如何被容器管理其寿命。</em></p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"构造器注入","id":"构造器注入"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为何构造器注入是首选","id":"为何构造器注入是首选"},{"level":2,"text":"不可变性与线程安全","id":"不可变性与线程安全"},{"level":2,"text":"完全初始化与快速失败","id":"完全初始化与快速失败"},{"level":2,"text":"参数膨胀是设计信号","id":"参数膨胀是设计信号"},{"level":2,"text":"Spring 4.3+ 的隐式构造器注入","id":"spring-4-3-的隐式构造器注入"},{"level":2,"text":"与 DDD 聚合根的契合","id":"与-ddd-聚合根的契合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"注入模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/foundations/injection-patterns"},"next":{"title":"作用域与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/implementation/scope-lifecycle"}}